{"resolucion":7,"mmi_minimo":5.5,"nota":"Malla agregada a r7 desde la resolucion de computo r8. `mmi` es la mayor de las celdas r8 que caen dentro, y cada una de esas es una COTA INFERIOR: lleva el valor de la isolinea que contiene el CENTRO de la celda, asi que una celda con el centro en la banda 7,0 y una esquina en la de 7,5 sale como 7,0. Nunca sobreestima. Las bandas son clases de intensidad del USGS: VI desde MMI 5,5, VII desde 6,5, VIII desde 7,5. `pop`, `pop7` y `pop8` son la poblacion de las celdas r8 con MMI>=5.5 (clase VI o mas), >=6.5 (VII o mas) y >=7.5 (VIII o mas): sumar `pop7` sobre todo el fichero da el `pop_mmi7p` del reporte. El resto de columnas son el agregado de las celdas r8 con MMI>=5.5, no de una banda concreta: no se pueden sumar filtrando por `mmi`.","columnas":["h3","mmi","pop","pop7","pop8","bld","built_m2","vias_km","salud","edu"],"celdas":[["8766b5750ffffff",6,231,0,0,146,28174,3.9,0,0],["8766b565dffffff",6,100,0,0,75,9641,5.6,0,0],["8766b56e9ffffff",6,1396,0,0,684,137692,15.8,0,0],["8766b5290ffffff",6,676,0,0,785,108080,13.4,0,0],["8766b566affffff",6,54,0,0,68,8190,5.1,0,0],["8766b56e8ffffff",6,824,0,0,441,74408,10.3,0,0],["8766b5748ffffff",6,757,0,0,617,85497,12.9,0,0],["8766b565cffffff",6,323,0,0,79,28660,5.3,0,0],["8766b5759ffffff",6,1192,0,0,721,127523,18.2,0,0],["8766b5623ffffff",6,1606,0,0,869,138647,10.1,0,0],["8766b5629ffffff",6,1230,0,0,527,96453,8.6,0,1],["8766b5625ffffff",6,125,0,0,95,12178,7.5,0,0],["8766b5665ffffff",6,266,0,0,266,30405,11.9,0,0],["8766b564effffff",6,64,0,0,50,9777,4.4,0,0],["8766b56e1ffffff",6,600,0,0,353,48577,12.1,0,0],["8766b574bffffff",6,642,0,0,461,72715,6.8,0,0],["8766b5666ffffff",6,124,0,0,121,12370,5.8,0,0],["8766b566effffff",6,51,0,0,91,7322,7.2,0,0],["8766b5758ffffff",6,62,0,0,94,5481,3.5,0,0],["8766b5671ffffff",6,13,0,0,42,1301,4.5,0,0],["8766b5621ffffff",6,1313,0,0,755,118871,9.6,0,1],["8766b575cffffff",6,586,0,0,445,67583,9.6,0,1],["8766b19a4ffffff",6,397,0,0,231,43490,5.1,0,0],["8766b562efff